47b955a94fa0a29 Required documentation includes: Cover letter addressing the qualifications cited above. Curriculum vita Names and contact information of three professional references Unofficial transcripts (Official transcripts due upon hire) All electronic submissions should be in Microsoft Word or PDF format. CONTACT INFORMATION: For questions about this faculty opening, please contact: Dr. LeAnna Willison at lwillison@thomasu.edu For more information or questions regarding submission of application materials please contact Anna Benefield, Director of Human Resources, at abenefield@thomasu.edu . Thomas University is committed to diversity. Thomas University is located in Thomasville, Georgia, approximately 35 miles north of Tallahassee, Florida. Thomas University Education that Engages ...Empowers... Transforms ™ 1550 Magnolia Street Thomasville, GA 31792 229.226.1621 Contact Us Peoples Bookstore & Spirit Shop HawkLink Student Accounts Financial Aid Campus Public & Media Relations Employment University Privacy Policy Consumer Information Website Feedback Follow Us thomas/1950/ @ThomasU1950 thomasuniversity ThomasUniversityTU © 2026 Thomas University. All Rights Reserved. Website developed and hosted by Pen Publishing Interactive"
